# Kudzu’s controller may select at most one land to attach it to, even when two are legal (CR 701.3a).
[Bot1 Deck]
Kudzu
Black Lotus
Dryad Arbor
Forest x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Kudzu.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Forest)
? Bot1.Mana =
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Dryad Arbor.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
! Bot1.Choose(Bot1.Battlefield.Dryad Arbor; Bot2.Battlefield.Island)
Bot1.Choose(Bot2.Battlefield.Island)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Forest; Black Lotus
Bot1.Battlefield.Kudzu.AttachedTo = Island
